  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket reporting this exact problem: the taskbar section in Shortcut Guide (v0.100.2, Shortcut Guide V2) being cut off on the left and misaligned. The closest tickets are different problems. PowerToys#44474 was numbers missing in the old guide and was closed once V2 shipped in 0.100. PowerToys#48435 covers the taskbar number indicator glitching when the taskbar is not at the bottom, and PowerToys#9105 covers a jerky adjustment with a left/right taskbar in the old guide. Please file this as a new issue, or add to #48435 if your taskbar is not at the bottom. Include your taskbar position, display resolution and scaling, and a PowerToys bug report ZIP so the team can reproduce it."
